# Shell scripts must keep LF line endings regardless of the checkout
# platform's core.autocrlf setting -- a CRLF shebang line breaks exec()
# at container runtime with a misleading "no such file or directory"
# error (confirmed: docker/entrypoint.sh silently got CRLF-converted on
# a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true, and the resulting image's
# ENTRYPOINT failed every run until this was fixed).
*.sh text eol=lf
